.TH NSSWITCH-COMPAT 5 "2026-10-26" "BetterMan regression fixture"
.SH NAME
nsswitch-compat \- nsswitch compatibility entries are configuration values
.SH DESCRIPTION
.SS Compatibility mode (compat)
The following entries are valid in this mode:
.RS 4
.PP
For
.B passwd
and
.B shadow
databases:
.RS 4
.TP 12
.BI + user
Include the specified user.
.TP
.BI + user::::::
Include the specified user with overridden fields.
.TP
.BI +@ netgroup
Include all users in the netgroup.
.TP
.BI \- user
Exclude the specified user.
.TP
.BI \-@ netgroup
Exclude all users in the netgroup.
.TP
.B +
Include all users not previously excluded.
.RE
.PP
For
.B group
database:
.RS 4
.TP 12
.BI + group
Include the specified group.
.TP
.BI \- group
Exclude the specified group.
.TP
.B +
Include all groups not previously excluded.
.RE
.RE
